"[HEADER] Installation Infos",
"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, sadx.apworld will be installed and moved into the 'custom_worlds' folder inside the Archipelago Launcher directory. The game's downpatcher and mod installer 'sadx_setup.exe' will then be installed into the game's Steam folder. The AP Mod folder will be downloaded inside 'mods'.",
